^warning: ignoring
--
Rounding overflow for double: when the rounding increment carries out of
the significand (fraction_size=53), the MSB must be set via
power(2, 52) rather than the C++ expression 1<<52, which is undefined
for int.  Regression test for GitHub issue #9200.
